13\pi/4 = 3\pi + \pi/4 = \pi + \pi/4 \Rightarrow e^{i \cdot 13\pi/4} = e^{i \cdot (\pi + \pi/4)} = e^{i\pi} \cdot e^{i\pi/4} = -e^{i\pi/4}
$$
$$
e^{-i \cdot 13\pi/4} = -e^{-i\pi/4}
