   $$
   \begin{bmatrix}
   -5 & -5 & 5 & 1 \\
   0 & 5 & -3 & \frac{16}{5} \\
   0 & 0 & -7 & -\frac{8}{5} \\
   0 & 0 & 6 & \frac{22}{5} \\
   \end{bmatrix}
   $$

3. **Eliminate the entry below the second pivot in column 3** using Row4 = Row4 + (6/7)Row3 (no determinant change).

   $$
   \begin{bmatrix}
   -5 & -5 & 5 & 1 \\
